OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Ember Basin
Description	A wide basin of lava and stone shared by four keepers. Quarter turn symmetric, so every approach to the middle costs the same. 4 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

